<title>NETHERLANDS: Smit Int 1996 net up sharply.</title>
<headline>Smit Int 1996 net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			 99   vs  21</p>
<p>    Turnover			  534   vs 473</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 31   vs  36</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)	    2.50 vs   2.00</p>
<p>    Interest charges		 10   vs   14</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gain	     74   vs    3 charge</p>
<p>Note - Shipping group Smit Internationale is a shipping group.</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
